  Recommended Learning Order
  
  1. Start with embeddings conceptually — understand what a vector representation of text means
  2. Understand cosine similarity — how "closeness" in vector space maps to semantic similarity
  3. Study the chunking strategy — this is where domain knowledge (log formats) meets RAG engineering
  4. Trace the full RAG pipeline — follow a query from RagController through RagService to the LLM
  5. Read the tests — RagServiceTest especially shows how to verify RAG behavior with mocks (the ArgumentCaptor test is a great pattern)
  
